  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>A favorite among assassins and military sharpshooters, the Sniper Blaster Rifle is a powerful and accurate Weapon ideal for eliminating targets at Long <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. Unwieldy in anything other than a prepared firing position, the Sniper Blaster Rifle is poorly suited for use in close combat. </p><p>If you do not <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aim\" title=\"Aim\">Aim</a> at your target immediately before making an attack with a Sniper Blaster Rifle, you take a -5 penalty on your attack roll. Sniper Blaster Rifles often have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bipod\" title=\"Bipod\">Bipod</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Targeting_Scope\" title=\"Targeting Scope\">Targeting Scope</a> mounted on them, but neither is included in the cost listed. A Sniper Blaster Rifle cannot benefit from the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rapid_Recycler\" title=\"Rapid Recycler\">Rapid Recycler</a> Weapon Upgrade. </p><p>A Sniper Blaster Rifle requires a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;to operate. After 10 shots, the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;must be replaced. </p><p><b>Accurate:</b> This weapon takes no penalty when firing at targets at Short&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
